  "problem": "Given that $f(x)={4}^{x}tan\u2061(x),$ find ${f}^{\u2032}(x).$\n\n${f}^{\u2032}(x)={4}^{x}ln\u2061(4)tan\u2061(x)\\,+$\n{{field-1}}",
